														I promised those I spoke with in guild chat that I would post this here for everyone else to see.<br />
Well, it seems that we're having some growing pains right now.  Our leader has been unavailable due to a broken computer, we've had arguments over how the guild should be managed and we've had several people leave for numerous reasons. <br />
I just wanted to say that its up to us to make this guild happen.  The thing is this isnt a power guild, its our guild and thats whats really cool about it. I would urge you to consider more what you can do to make the guild better than what the guild can do for you. If we do that then the latter will follow.						</td>
