						<td width="100%" class="body" valign="top">
														&quot;Ask not what your guild can do for you, but rather what you can do for your guild&quot;. Good words for any era! I have had people throw buffs on me &quot;just because&quot; of the guild I'm in! I had one lady tell me after buffing me that I had a &quot;very honorable guild&quot;. I try to help all those I come across, in order to help make this guild honorable and I have done this mostly on my own, by myself with no groups. I think I will get a job as the &quot;Tour-Guid&quot; of Felweith since I seem to spend so much time there! <br />
I was honored to be invited into this guild, but had my doubts as to weather I was really welcome. Those doubts have begun to subside . . . but it is still nice to know that you're appreciated.<br />
