						<td width="100%" class="body" valign="top">
														I myself have donned the robe of Raidership.  Is that a word.  I hope to instill a fraternal bond among us all that only comes from constant exposure to each other.  As a sociological experiment I have now thrown all my resources at starting a Monday RaidNight.  That's right Monday night, every Monday night.  5pm PST.  I hope we can do one Major on the even weeks and one minor on the odd weeks.  This gives us an oppurtunity to 'initiate' our newer members into guild tactics, and gives us a chance to show off our alts.  Monday the 5th is a minor, we are heading for Najena, Monday March 12th we are heading for Dalnir.  Please if you read this, promote it.  Tell everyone that we have a guild page, and its right here!<br />
<br />
I also hope that by the time we are planes ready or dragon ready, that we have a well oiled machine ready to take on any adversity.<br />
<br />
If you have any ideas for a RaidNight email me at doogan@gci.net or post em here.  If the times need adjusting for our guild please post appropriate times of play or suggestions for additional nights.  <br />
<br />
<br />
See you all in Game<br />
<br />
Thadius A'merot						</td>
